WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Crouching light punch whiffs as Ryu recovers from the prerequisite Uppercut.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:00.900
Ryu reaches for a throw while Luke moves away.

3
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.900
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw whiff.

4
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.125
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.125
Light Sand Blast continues the corner juggle.

6
00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:05.950
Light Rising Uppercut ends the punish.
